ght Roasted\n          </span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           风味：黄柠檬、葡萄柚、蔓越莓、红布林\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           Lemon, Grapefruit, Cranberry, Red plum\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           风味特征词：黄色柑橘+红色莓果核果\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这是时隔2年后第三次买到Bernadina这个品种，同时选到2个批次，日晒和蜜处理；比起前几年对于这个豆种的经验来说，今年的都很干净，风味辨识度都很够，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          日晒批次和蜜处理批次同样有着黄色柑橘和红色莓果的复合果香果酸调性\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          不同的是蜜处理的酸感更上扬扎实\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          日晒的酸甜偏向柔顺饱满，都好喝～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibmprdLETzwOhuwbE8a8EvgEsJS3yjniax42OYrT1NeGIqD6jLY8G5bVw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           La Esperanza 位于上图左上角Santa Ana区域\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           关于希望庄园和Bernadina品种\n          </span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           希望庄园位于萨尔瓦多的Santa Ana-Apaneca区域\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           ，属于Pacas家族，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            Pacas家族已经是\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            五代\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            的咖啡\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            家族\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            ，Pacas品种正是由该\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n            家族最早发现于其农场而得名\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           。希望庄园是Pacas家族于2010年11月买入，买入前它已经在种植咖啡，但由于叶锈病的影响，Pacas家族决定对它重新进行改造，维护土壤，种植新的品种。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaS1w8uH2v2dAfExibpXTgbUbCelQib4Dbeehu1oxDBFo4ibb1aoNQiahPib2Nu1NPZHxjf2QLhgicZCUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 425px;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           Bernadina这个品种最早是2013年，前农场经理Ruperto Bernadino Merche在Los Bellotos（2009年购入）发现的，据Bernadino讲这些树已经存在了60-70年了，Bernadino\n          </span>\n<span>\n           一直跟农场主讲他们可能是不一样的品种，它\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           的成熟总比周边其它树（波旁）更晚，它的咖啡花香也不一样，果子形状也不一样，但前庄园主觉得无所谓，于是每一年都是将这几棵树的产出和其它咖啡树混在一起处理的；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rhh3m9NlGkulM2ZpiagQkA8M7FtCaXZFPstr0x45oNiaicxcx4w2SC6dNLXEhnMVA6cI5e2e9JeP5rw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           直到2017年，当他再一次和新的管理者Maria来讲时，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           Maria对这5棵树非常的好奇，她决定将它们产出的咖啡果单独脱皮做处理，然后Maria就发了一些样本给她的老客户，澳洲的知名烘焙商Proud Mary，在Proud Mary烘焙后测样时它的表现让Proud Mary团队大吃一惊，它的风味喝起来让人第一反应就是这是瑰夏吧?随后，Proud Mary以25美元/磅的价格（以往最高5美元的单价已经是很高的价格了），跟Maria买了当年所有的产出，命名时为了感谢Ruperto Bernadino Merche的坚持，Maria将它命名为Bernadina\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           ；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           随后，庄园也将该品种送往意大利的一个检测中心进行基因鉴定，结论是Bernadina有70%的瑰夏基因，另外30%的基因与埃塞的一个agaro非常相近。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rhh3m9NlGkulM2ZpiagQkA8r1ZUcBMT0Lh4blqtlibpFt93hlwBvqLjCLC2ia8lfmIdfZcxMfSVLnXg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rhh3m9NlGkulM2ZpiagQkA8gGjtibM0AMVovJmUck6P5NF7I6wllqqx8OMnia1FksXBgxupMgLo5micA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rhh3m9NlGkulM2ZpiagQkA8eek2zHgOB8icXtKCdiaNCuNGNnUXnBsaicaxcKbPjqVicEf3GcoaIjoGOw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rhh3m9NlGkulM2ZpiagQkA8tBdjUfuZ7WkFrQ5cgciaBS1D8uSwVUVPW20f6Hb8CjvCjvibsOnVCJcA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n            Bernardina被发现后经过了十年多，被分种到了La Esperanza，Santa Sofia，Los Bellotos，Santa Juana，La Guachoca，El Retiro，等帕卡斯家族旗下庄园。处理法的部分也在多次试验后，大货选择传统的水洗，日晒，蜜处理来进行。少部分有厌氧处理的实验批次。\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaS1w8uH2v2dAfExibpXTgbeWAJzhDaHuxz9B21fjT9Lzm6HEhnibhia2yWsbFydbU2A0k6aSduVXUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           希望庄园于2012年\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span>\n           重新翻新土壤后，种植了包括Bernadina在内的多个品种（其余品种有红波旁Red Bourbon、帕卡玛拉Pacamara、帕卡斯Pacas、肯尼亚、摩卡Mocca、埃塞原生种等）。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-seri